#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**SWAP gate**\n"
msgstr "**SWAP gate**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The SWAP gate swaps the states of two qubits.\n"
msgstr "SWAP gate สลับสถานะของ Qubit สองตัว\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Composer reference                                  | OpenQASM reference | Q-sphere | Note about q-sphere representations                                                                                                                                                                                                     |\n"
"| --------------------------------------------------- | ------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
