msgstr "**RCCX gate**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The simplified Toffoli gate, also referred to as Margolus gate.\n"
msgstr "simplified Toffoli gate หรือที่เรียกว่า Margolus gate\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The simplified Toffoli gate implements the Toffoli gate up to relative "
"phases. This implementation requires three CX gates, which is the minimal "
"amount possible, as shown in https://arxiv.org/abs/quant-ph/0312225. Note "
"that the simplified Toffoli is not equivalent to the Toffoli, but can be "
"used in places where the Toffoli gate is uncomputed again.\n"
msgstr ""
"simplified Toffoli gate implement Toffoli gate จนถึง relative phases การ "
"implement นี้ต้องใช้ CX gates สามตัว ซึ่งเป็นจำนวนน้อยที่สุดที่เป็นไปได้ "
"ตามที่แสดงใน https://arxiv.org/abs/quant-ph/0312225 โปรดทราบว่า simplified "
"Toffoli ไม่เทียบเท่ากับ Toffoli แต่สามารถใช้ในที่ที่ Toffoli gate ถูก "
"uncomputed อีกครั้ง\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Composer reference                        | OpenQASM reference | Q-sphere | Note about q-sphere representations                                                                                                                                                                                                     |\n"
"| ----------------------------------------- | ------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| ![rccx-gate](/docs/images/guides/composer/6cdded97-f988-42c6-81c2-f901fd22f692.avif) | `rccx a, b, c;`    | ![rccx\\_qsph](/docs/images/guides/composer/e4efe9af-7bfb-4753-93f7-6f3b2933ef78.avif)                        | The q-sphere representation shows the state after the gate operates on the initial equal superposition state $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2^{n}}}\\sum_{i=0}^{2^{n}-1}\\vert i\\rangle, $ where $n$ is the number of qubits needed to support the gate. |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Composer reference                        | OpenQASM reference | Q-sphere | หมายเหตุเกี่ยวกับ q-sphere representations                                                                                                                                                                                                     |\n"
"| ----------------------------------------- | ------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n"
"| ![rccx-gate](/docs/images/guides/composer/6cdded97-f988-42c6-81c2-f901fd22f692.avif) | `rccx a, b, c;`    | ![rccx\\_qsph](/docs/images/guides/composer/e4efe9af-7bfb-4753-93f7-6f3b2933ef78.avif)                        | q-sphere representation แสดงสถานะหลังจาก Gate ดำเนินการบน initial equal superposition state $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2^{n}}}\\sum_{i=0}^{2^{n}-1}\\vert i\\rangle, $ โดยที่ $n$ คือจำนวน Qubit ที่จำเป็นสำหรับรองรับ Gate |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "**RC3X gate**\n"
msgstr "**RC3X gate**\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "The simplified 3-controlled Toffoli gate.\n"
msgstr "simplified 3-controlled Toffoli gate\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The simplified Toffoli gate implements the Toffoli gate up to relative "
"phases. Note that the simplified Toffoli is not equivalent to the Toffoli, "
"but can be used in places where the Toffoli gate is uncomputed again.\n"
